.\" Prose template for share/man/man1/dot.1. The COMMANDS and ALIASES
.\" sections are generated from the command registry in bin/dot by
.\" tools/docs/generate-manpage.sh — edit THIS file for prose, edit
.\" bin/dot (_dot_help_specs / _dot_help_details) for command text,
.\" then run `make man`. CI fails when share/man/man1/dot.1 is stale.
.TH DOT 1 "@DATE@" "dotfiles v@VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dot \- dotfiles management CLI
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dot
.RI [ command ]
.RI [ subcommand ]
.RI [ options ]
.br
.B dot help
.RI [ command ]
.br
.B dot help all
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B dot
is the control plane for a chezmoi-managed dotfiles system. It provides
commands for applying configuration, diagnostics, repair, security, and
AI-assisted development workflows.
.PP
Every command accepts
.B \-\-help
and
.BR \-h .
Run
.B dot help all
for the complete reference,
.B dot search
.I keyword
to find a command, and
.B dot completion
.I shell
to generate shell completions from the same registry that produced this
page.
.SH COMMANDS
@COMMANDS@
.SH ALIASES AND HIDDEN COMMANDS
The dispatcher also routes the following names. They are aliases,
deprecated bridges, or advanced entry points that are kept out of
.B dot help
to reduce noise; each still works and documents itself with
.BR \-\-help .
@ALIASES@
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B DOTFILES_FAST=1
Skip heavy layers (zinit, completions) for fast startup.
.TP
.B DOTFILES_ULTRA_FAST=1
Bare minimum shell (aliases + prompt only).
.TP
.B DOTFILES_AI=1
Enable AI helper scripts.
.TP
.B DOTFILES_NONINTERACTIVE=1
Force non-interactive mode (for CI/scripts).
.TP
.B DOTFILES_PREWARM_ON_APPLY=1
Auto-prewarm caches after dot apply (default: enabled).
.TP
.B CHEZMOI_SOURCE_DIR
Override the resolved source tree. Used by packaged installs that keep
the framework outside
.IR ~/.dotfiles .
.TP
.B NO_COLOR=1
Disable ANSI colour in every command.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.dotfiles/
Repository root (chezmoi source).
.TP
.I ~/.config/chezmoi/chezmoi.toml
Per-machine overrides.
.TP
.I ~/.config/dotfiles/commands/
User-provided custom dot commands.
.TP
.I ~/.config/dotfiles/modules.d/
User-provided aliases and functions.
.TP
.I ~/.config/zsh/rc.d.local/
User-provided zsh initialization scripts.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/dotfiles.log
Local action log. No telemetry leaves the machine.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.B 0
on success,
.B 1
on a command failure,
.B 2
on usage errors (unknown command, bad flags).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR chezmoi (1),
.BR mise (1),
.BR zsh (1)
.PP
Manual: https://doc.dotfiles.io/ \(em source in
.I docs/manual/
of the repository.
.SH AUTHORS
Sebastien Rousseau <sebastian.rousseau@gmail.com>
.SH BUGS
Report issues at https://github.com/sebastienrousseau/dotfiles/issues
.br
